  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome, wait a few
      seconds while the GPU renders the 48 kHz soundtrack and
      warms the shaders, then click anywhere to start.
      No server, no browser flags. Press ESC to exit fullscreen.
      Requires a discrete GPU (tested on RTX 5090 @ 1080p60).

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    technical notes
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      - Single-file ISO-8859-15 double-click HTML payload packed
        with terser + zopfli and unpacked via DecompressionStream
      - 7-scene raymarched SDF world + 1 reflection bounce, soft
        shadows, 5-tap AO, thin-film iridescence, and curved
        spacetime ray-bending for the gravitational lens
      - Mip-chain bloom, horizontal anamorphic lens streaks,
        scene-cut slit-scan glitch, ACES tonemap, and an
        8-row procedural typography texture
      - 128 BPM GPU synth in GLSL ES 3.0 (4096x1620 RGBA32F):
        breakbeat/four-on-floor kick, dry snare + rolls,
        5-partial metallic hats, Reese sub bass, chord-diatonic
        Acid 303 bass, formant pad, glass harp arp, C-minor
        vibrato lead + dotted-8th ping-pong echo, and a
        gravitational Shepard glissando

